    <item>
      <title>0.2.0</title>
      <pubDate>Fri, 23 Oct 2026 19:28:29 GMT</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>21</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.2.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<ul><li>Mac QA round 1 fixes: damaged-sheet recovery, episodes, imports, isolation</li><li>Data safety: library lock, verified caches, resilient open, refuse to drop unsaved text</li><li>Mac app: SwiftUI shell on the Rust core, editor, menus, backups, episodes</li><li>Core backups, episode metadata, platform counts; Mac release tooling</li><li>Rust core: model, hash-chain ledger, on-disk store with migrations, FFI</li><li>Add a usable web app for daily writing, and flesh out settings and the app shell</li><li>Replace glyph icons and hand-drawn controls with an icon set and shared kit</li><li>Draw the five planned screens: new project, search, history, export, pairing</li><li>Use colosan as the repository identity in AGENTS.md</li><li>design:snap: headless screenshot regression + defect report for agents</li><li>Safe areas: per-device insets, overlay, detection, prototype padding</li><li>Text size simulation, desktop min window, and the fixes they found</li><li>Device presets: 74 verified-or-flagged sizes, latest models as defaults</li><li>Fix a code comment that quoted Korean UI text</li><li>Workbench detail: four base screens + one device per family</li><li>Workbench: device sectors, interactive prototypes, focus view</li><li>Workbench: undo/redo, reset to initial state, pannable detail, folding lanes</li><li>Workbench: purpose-driven upgrade from hands-on use</li><li>Design: folder model, three new screens, platform-aware frames</li><li>Scaffold Ithaca: ADRs, design system data, generators, workbench</li></ul>]]></description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/colosan/project_ithaca/releases/download/v0.2.0/Ithaca-0.2.0.zip" length="3478492" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="vV0/ti0n22yq8iU78NVHWwjY+77e5f0K7L5Bf9hbVaeGAHqwDzftIQ2z0JDaQ9fchBoyd7MaWnSWIAnl9ilzDA=="/>
    </item>
